<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Customer onboarding</h2>
<p>For customer onboarding, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record customer onboarding opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. In customer onboarding, mistimed sends after purchases, refunds, or support cases destroy channel value quicker than any creative miss.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Audience state</th><th>Required handling</th><th>Why it matters</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>Hold all customer onboarding marketing; transactional only</td><td>Without customer onboarding consent proof, marketing has no legal footing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Lead customer onboarding newcomers with teaching and social proof</td><td>First-touch customer onboarding codes create discount dependence</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Customer Onboarding cart reminder first; earn the discount decision</td><td>Margin-safe customer onboarding recovery at peak intent</td></tr>
<tr><td>Purchased recently</td><td>Suppress customer onboarding selling after checkout; educate instead</td><td>Keeps customer onboarding buyers from instant list fatigue</td></tr>
<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>No customer onboarding promos mid-case; resume after resolution</td><td>Customer Onboarding messaging lands badly during open cases</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Sunset cold customer onboarding contacts before complaints build</td><td>Customer Onboarding inboxing survives on timely sunsets</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Cap customer onboarding SMS cadence within legal quiet windows</td><td>One customer onboarding SMS complaint outweighs many email ones</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wholesale or B2B account</td><td>Customer Onboarding B2B routing stays account-specific</td><td>B2B customer onboarding mis-sends risk contract breach</td></tr>
<tr><td>Free or disposable email domain</td><td>Customer Onboarding automation skips unverified domains first</td><td>Customer Onboarding bounces from junk signups hurt inboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Staff and test accounts</td><td>Strip customer onboarding test data from live journeys</td><td>Customer Onboarding test sends skew attribution reads</td></tr>
<tr><td>Competitor or researcher signals</td><td>Treat customer onboarding snoops under normal consent policy</td><td>Manual customer onboarding exceptions rot the audit trail</td></tr>
<tr><td>Legacy list without timestamps</td><td>Re-permission legacy customer onboarding lists pre-automation</td><td>Customer Onboarding compliance demands re-permission</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt-12">Margin, app costs, and pricing for Customer onboarding</h2>
