<ol>
<li>Customer Onboarding code-freeze starts fourteen days out.</li>
<li>Exercise each customer onboarding flow with live purchase, refund, support tests.</li>
<li>For customer onboarding, confirm buyer and return exclusions hold.</li>
<li>Customer Onboarding measurement needs bigger peak holdouts.</li>
<li>Customer Onboarding texting policy written before peak.</li>
